    the Damage Step): You can make all "Ancient Warriors" monsters you control gain
    300 ATK for each "Ancient Warriors" monster you control until the end of this
    turn (even if this card leaves the field). You can only use each effect of "Ancient
    Warriors Saga - Sun-Liu Alliance" once per turn.'
